I just ascended for the first time.  Played a valk, later turned
into a Mr. Valk.  The game sparked a question and an observation.

1.  With my handy blessed tinning kit I tinned away at several
  monsters, including a couple tengu.  Despite blessed tengu tins,
  I never gained intrinsic teleport control.

2.  Why should a chaotic character sacrifice humans to attract
  a Demonlord?  I've tried chatting to no avail.  My guess is
  either for the opportunity to tame the Demonlord as a pet,
  or simply to summon him now so that you don't have to face
  him later in Hell.


